This is a placeholder for the project timeline image.
The image needs to be manually generated from the mermaid markdown in project-timeline.md
and saved as project-timeline.png in this directory.

You can generate this image using:
1. Paste the mermaid diagram code from project-timeline.md into https://mermaid.live/
2. Export as PNG
3. Save the PNG as project-timeline.png in the docs/assets/ directory

This is needed to ensure diagrams render properly on GitHub mobile. 